*> Entity models part 5 section 12 (Tadpole): the mesh (12), the tail swing, texture and shadow.
*> Entry points for the integrator (inputs; the table programs take IN (16 FLOAT-LONG) and OUT (64 FLOAT-LONG)):
*>   EF5-TADPOLE-ANIM EMM-MODEL state(1 in water, 2 ageInTicks): reset first, tail.yRot = -f x 0.25 x sin(0.3 A), f 1 in water else 1.5; EF5-TADPOLE-TEXTURE path(out X(120)); EF5-TADPOLE-SHADOW IN() OUT(radius).


 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF5-M-TADPOLE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-ROWS.
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P body root 0 22 -3 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C body 0 0 -1.5 -1 0 3 2 3 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "P tail root 0 22 0 0 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE "C tail 0 0 0 -1 0 0 2 7 0 0".
    05 FILLER PIC X(100) VALUE SPACES OCCURS 76 TIMES.
 01 WS-ROWS-R REDEFINES WS-ROWS.
    05 WS-ROW              PIC X(100) OCCURS 80 TIMES.
 01 WS-N                   BINARY-LONG VALUE 4.
 01 WS-ZERO                FLOAT-LONG VALUE 0.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLEMM.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EMM-MODEL.
     CALL "EMM-INIT" USING EMM-MODEL
     CALL "EM3-ROWS" USING EMM-MODEL WS-ROWS-R WS-N WS-ZERO
     MOVE 16 TO MM-TEXW
     MOVE 16 TO MM-TEXH
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF5-M-TADPOLE.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF5-TADPOLE-ANIM.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-NAME                PIC X(24).
 01 WS-T                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-F                   FLOAT-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLEMM.
 01 L-IN.
    05 L-I                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EMM-MODEL L-IN.
     CALL "EMM-RESET" USING EMM-MODEL
     MOVE "tail" TO WS-NAME
     CALL "EMM-FIND" USING EMM-MODEL WS-NAME WS-T
     MOVE 1.5 TO WS-F
     IF L-I(1) NOT = 0
         MOVE 1 TO WS-F
     END-IF
     COMPUTE MM-CYROT(WS-T) = 0 - WS-F * 0.25 * FUNCTION SIN(0.3 * L-I(2))
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF5-TADPOLE-ANIM.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF5-TADPOLE-TEXTURE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-PATH                 PIC X(120).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-PATH.
     MOVE "textures/entity/tadpole/tadpole.png" TO L-PATH
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF5-TADPOLE-TEXTURE.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EF5-TADPOLE-SHADOW.
 DATA DIVISION.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-IN.
    05 L-I                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 16 TIMES.
 01 L-OUT.
    05 L-O                 FLOAT-LONG OCCURS 64 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-IN L-OUT.
     MOVE 0.14 TO L-O(1)
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM EF5-TADPOLE-SHADOW.
